node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
.dsh-uploads/
.trash/
pnpm-workspace.yaml
benchmark/local/
benchmark/*.real.json
# Benchmark fixtures are deterministic generator output, not sources. Every
# entry point that reads them regenerates them first (pretest, and each
# benchmark:* script), so a fresh clone needs nothing committed here.
#
# Three of them used to be tracked, from before this rule existed. Nothing
# verified that those committed bytes still matched the generator, so they could
# drift silently while every test passed — the generator is the only source of
# truth, and it is versioned.
#
# This also hides the NFD filename aliases that Git and macOS cannot represent
# portably across NFC/NFD-sensitive filesystems.
benchmark/fixtures/generated/*
